{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10A Problems\">2006 AMC 10A #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sandwiches at Joe's Fast Food cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831d26f39684cd7cfa4ae5f2a0098b432dc8a6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> each and sodas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> each. How many dollars will it cost to purchase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sandwiches and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sodas?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e73ac12255c5b0558d6de1e5a0c6373724cdeef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 31\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 32\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 33\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 34\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sandwiches cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9c7707a54996c691e35f5bacf1a46e2e9ba7312.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\cdot 3=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> dollars. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sodas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fba88cd918ade8a912d9b953950b940e010a7fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\cdot 2=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> dollars. In total, the purchase costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92c16949918905389d7f8ed42dc680d0c5c5703f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+16=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"150\" height=\"30\" /> dollars.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a